  "notModeled": [
    "analog input, reference and IRS input-range strap (the result is always the 0 V code: mid-scale 0x200 in offset binary)",
    "DF pin: DF high selects two's complement output (0 V code 0x000); the schema has a fixed codeFormat, so the model is offset binary (DF low)",
    "pipeline latency of 6 clock cycles (the code is constant); clock frequency limits",
    "STBY: the output data pins are undefined in standby and 20 clock cycles are needed to exit (the model's powerdown only blocks conversions)",
    "CLK, DF and STBY inputs are TTL-level (VIH 2 V) inputs on the VDDA (2.7-3.6 V) domain; outputs on VDDIO (2.5 V to VDDA); vcc is the union 2.5-3.6 V"
  ],
